<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>CCRControlEventsOrigin</key>
    <string>$(CCR_CONTROL_EVENTS_ORIGIN)</string>
    <key>BTSourceCommit</key>
    <string>$(BT_RELEASE_SOURCE_COMMIT)</string>
    <key>BTSourceTree</key>
    <string>$(BT_RELEASE_SOURCE_TREE)</string>
    <key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
    <dict>
        <key>NSAllowsArbitraryLoadsInWebContent</key>
        <true/>
    </dict>
    <key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
    <string>마이크 전송을 켜면 선택한 Mac으로 음성을 보냅니다. 같은 저장된 Mac에 다시 연결하면 허용한 전송을 재개합니다. 앱이 비활성화되거나 연결이 끊기면 전송을 중지합니다.</string>
    <key>NSBonjourServices</key>
    <array>
        <string>_sill._tcp</string>
    </array>
</dict>
</plist>
